IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hesa-help`

-- Higher Education Support Act 2003 (Cth), ss 36-5, 36-10, 90-1, 90-5, 93-1, 93-10, 93-20, 104-1, 104-5, 128-15, 128-20, 137-10, 137-19A, 140-5, 140-10, 140-25, 140-26, 154-1, 154-5, 154-10, 154-15, 154-20 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_higher-education-support-act-2003.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts: Chloe enrols in a Bachelor of Commerce at UWA on 22 February 2021 (c030), earns $27,500 in 2023-24 (c045)
-- and $71,500 in 2024-25 (c048); Daniel enrols in a Bachelor of Commerce at UWA on 24 February 2014 (d020) and a Juris
-- Doctor on 27 February 2017 (d022). The census dates, contribution amounts, loans, HELP balances, debts and indexation
-- factors below are HYPOTHETICAL inputs, not figures from the scenarios or the Act unless a comment says so.

